@title Terminals drawer: the toolbar is one row, so the strip keeps its rows
@area Terminals
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Regression (TCN-04): wrapped tool buttons took two rows of the drawer at 1366x768.
open qa/fixtures/strip-grouping.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+3
wait 10
expect "Terminals"
shot terminals-toolbar-one-row
check_layout
